hub.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2558060372","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100669#issuecomment-2558060372","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100669","id":2558060372,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6YeOdU","user":{"login":"Wiechciu","id":84104920,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0MTA0OTIw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/84104920?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wiechciu","html_url":"https://github.com/Wiechciu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wiechciu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wiechciu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wiechciu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wiechciu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wiechciu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wiechciu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wiechciu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wiechciu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Wiechciu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-21T09:17:17Z","updated_at":"2024-12-21T09:27:43Z","body":"> I was able to work backwards from the shader. The bug requires using a font with MSDF enabled. The default font doesn't have MSDF, so it doesn't trigger this bug.\n> \n> Ideally your reproduction steps would have included that information to save me time. But in this case the error in the shader code had everything I needed to figure it out quickly, so it was no problem! I've already made a PR to fix this issue :) [#100678](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100678)\n\nHi @clayjohn, thanks for the fix, but I actually don't use any custom font in my project, only the default ones. Is there any way I can test your fix to see if it actually was the rootcause?\nOr if I can provide you with any 